  (b) in Section 2, condition (b), the label "(a)", the paragraph
      beginning "Both (a) and (b)", and the paragraph beginning "In
      this license" are deleted;

  (c) Section 1 and Sections 4 through 6 cease to have effect;

  (d) this Section 3 ceases to have effect, the conversion it makes
      having already taken effect irrevocably; and

  (e) the License Details block, the section headings, and the
      section numbering become a record of this release and have no
